# Large reference data. Two of these blow GitHub's hard 100MB-per-file
# push limit outright (ratings260801.ssp is 516MB, crosstables.json is
# 159MB); 17 of the 27 player-registry shards do too (largest 547MB), and
# since shard sizes shift across that line as the source .ssp grows, the
# whole directory is excluded rather than tracking whichever shards
# happen to be under the limit today. Kept on disk, not version-
# controlled; see HANDOFF.md. Everything else under assets/ (all.tsv,
# registries/events.xml, registries/places/) is comfortably small and
# stays tracked.
assets/*.ssp
assets/crosstables.json
assets/registries/players/
